      "writtenOn": "2021-05-20T03:53:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even though sdk_version: \"current\" would work for now, but I guess set it to 29 is better.\nBecause sdk_version is still the most solid way to make thing compatible.\nThat said, we should probably set it to newer SDK only if we need.",
